// Every race owns its own creation FLOW (which steps it walks through), its
// own social BACKGROUNDS, its own TRACKS, and its own racial sheet tab. A
// choice at one step decides which options the next step offers — Barbarians
// skip the city entirely; the others branch on background — and every route
// ends at the same review screen.
var RACES = [
  {
    id: "Barbarian",
    seed: 3,
    base: { strength: 9, flexibility: 5, vision: 4, smell: 4, accuracy: 4 },
    spirit: 5,
    tag: "Born to fight. Marked by shamans.",
    ability: "Spirit Imprints, cut into the skin by the shaman. Not a starting choice: you pick an imprint path later, at the shaman's tent, and pay for each stage in stones.",
