// ---- tracks: what the body can begin as --------------------------------
// A track is where the body starts, never a class lock. Racial powers that
// canon says are chosen for you (aura, the Soul Tree) are NOT tracks; they
// are talents rolled once and kept out of sight until the world reveals them.
