          </div>
          <div style={{ marginTop: 12 }}>
            <Btn wide onClick={goRegister}>
              {atGuild ? "REGISTER AT THE DESK" : "GO TO DISTRICT 9 AND REGISTER"}
            </Btn>
          </div>
          <Empty>
            Registration puts your face and your race in a ledger the ministry
