          <div style={{ display: "flex", justifyContent: "space-between", marginTop: 3 }}>
            <span style={{ fontSize: 9, color: C.boneFaint }}>
              {atSovereignGate ? "held at Master — waiting on the fiction, not the number" : prof + "% to " +
