// The deterministic layer. This owns where you are, what is solid, what you
// have walked, how much damage landed, and whether an essence dropped.
// The GM is not consulted about whether a wall is a wall.


// ==== oracle =================================================================
// Combat stays yours to narrate. This only ever fires once a body is already
// down in your own prose. It never decides a fight — it decides what falls
// out of one, at the exact rates canon states, and it cannot be talked out
// of them by a good scene.

function arr_oracle(v) { return Array.isArray(v) ? v : []; }
